            "CMR6",
            "CMR9"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            5.98,
            8.97
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spaces considered by Dixon [12], and the construction of minimal ideals considered by Furey [15] depend on the",
          "bbox": [
            70.87,
            725.47,
            524.46,
            734.44
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "CMR9"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.97
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "existence of nilpotents and primitive idempotents. These do not exist in normed division algebras, but do in their",
          "bbox": [
            70.87,
            736.43,
