            745.4
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "CMR9"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            8.97
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "split algebra cousins. For example, when working in C ⊗H or C ⊗O one uses a primitive idempotent to select a",
          "bbox": [
